{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32199","headline":"秘书刘尚书挽歌词二首 二 · 温庭筠","name":"秘书刘尚书挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麈尾近良玉，鹤裘吹素丝。\n坏陵殷浩谪，春墅谢安棊。\n京口贵公子，襄阳诸女儿。\n折花兼踏月，多唱柳郎词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}